{
  "name": "dsh-ui-dock",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "把 DSH 主界面拆成开关：逐个隐藏/显示左栏、会话列表、标题栏、消息区、输入框、右栏；左下角条目（费用、插件市场、记忆、账号）可逐项开关；齿轮可换图标、调大小、拖到任意位置，随时恢复；面板文案支持中英文切换，并可调整侧栏字号行高与面板停靠。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "sidebar",
    "layout",
    "ui"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.4"
  }
}
